<% location = [ @application.letter_venue, @application.letter_address, @application.letter_city, @application.letter_country ].compact_blank.uniq.join(", ") %>
<h1>Your Visa Letter is Ready!</h1>

<p>Hello <%= @application.full_name %>,</p>

<p>Great news! Your visa letter application for <strong><%= @application.letter_event_name %></strong> has been approved. Your letter is attached to this email.</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Download Your Visa Letter (PDF)", @download_url %>
</p>

<p><small>Or copy this link: <%= @download_url %></small></p>

<h2>Event Details</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Event:</strong> <%= @application.letter_event_name %></li>
  <li><strong>Dates:</strong> <%= @application.letter_date_range %></li>
  <li><strong>Location:</strong> <%= location %></li>
  <li><strong>Reference Number:</strong> <%= @application.reference_number %></li>
</ul>

<h2>Next Steps</h2>
<p>Please print this letter and include it with your visa application. If you have any questions or need additional documentation, please contact us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>

<p>Once you hear back from the embassy, please let us know on your application page, using the link above.</p>

<p>We look forward to seeing you at <%= @application.letter_event_name %>!</p>
